{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the toga of a Roman governor and build your own ancient empire from the ground up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Antiquitas is a historical city-building simulation from the creator of My Colony, set in the golden age of Rome. Grow your civilization from a humble village into a mighty empire, managing resources, citizens, and trade across expansive ancient landscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Build anytime, anywhere - no connection required!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Resource production and trade</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Full colony simulation \u2013 housing, jobs, education, entertainment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Deep tech tree spanning Roman innovation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Trade and interact with other players online (optional)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a seasoned city-builder or new to the genre, Antiquitas offers a rewarding and relaxing empire management experience with no time limits or paywalls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your rise to glory today!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/935750?t=1745594445","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/935750/f978ae67956eaf3025abd998870c7f8322576a47/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745594445","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/935750/2322cab23d71df855f9b655832bd2da875d66bfd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745594445","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/935750/2322cab23d71df855f9b655832bd2da875d66bfd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745594445","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_suppor